        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa diwu majina awatulamba akudi Esawu, mwahita yisakayawu, mwahita nyikala yawu, mwahita nimajinawu; kalamba Timina, kalamba Aliva, kalamba Yeteti, ",
          "type": "text",
