              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kalamba Magidiyeli, kalamba Irami; wenawa diwu atulamba aEdomi, mwatupiluwu nyikala yawu mwituŋa dawu daheteluwu. Diyi Esawu tataya waEdomi.",
          "type": "text",
